        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to the Aquance Isle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A holding place for Poppy before they enter the Sanctum. <br>The island is full of friends who are nervous and weary about their potential new home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/adadd24a26d4a828d40762ee7a0b1d69.poster.avif?t=1788973110\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/adadd24a26d4a828d40762ee7a0b1d69.webm?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/adadd24a26d4a828d40762ee7a0b1d69.mp4?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the Aquance Isle. A small island where mages, poppy, tridal, and the fearsome coralmander occupy. <br>A place surrounded by the great midland ocean, where heavy rains fall, and beautiful sunsets exist.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/5f29f4c5b96fced96993030f349d2b52.poster.avif?t=1788973110\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/5f29f4c5b96fced96993030f349d2b52.webm?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/5f29f4c5b96fced96993030f349d2b52.mp4?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">In order to escape the island you'll need to gather a pack. A group of poppy friends to help you solve the puzzle of the island. They may ask for favors or just want to hang out. <br>Be careful though not to upset them, as the slightest bump can set a poppy off.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/4fc6316b62bcc38eb8c466edc2e6a74c.poster.avif?t=1788973110\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/4fc6316b62bcc38eb8c466edc2e6a74c.webm?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/4fc6316b62bcc38eb8c466edc2e6a74c.mp4?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">With a large enough pack you'll be able to perform feats of thermion magic. <br>A powerful tool in repelling enemies, or causing mayhem.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/c05bbad24c178196851c468047a41f14.poster.avif?t=1788973110\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/c05bbad24c178196851c468047a41f14.webm?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/c05bbad24c178196851c468047a41f14.mp4?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The island is overseen by a powerful Aquance mage, a manipulator of water. <br>Holding the key to leaving the island, you'll need to become a true demon in order to defeat this mage.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hand drawn pixel-art and low-poly style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whimsical and interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Physics-driven gameplay mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cuteness overload.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A short, mysterious puzzle to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Original music full of mysterious ambiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Around 10-30 minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Red pandas! <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to the Aquance Isle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A holding place for Poppy before they enter the Sanctum. <br>The island is full of friends who are nervous and weary about their potential new home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/adadd24a26d4a828d40762ee7a0b1d69.poster.avif?t=1788973110\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/adadd24a26d4a828d40762ee7a0b1d69.webm?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/adadd24a26d4a828d40762ee7a0b1d69.mp4?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the Aquance Isle. A small island where mages, poppy, tridal, and the fearsome coralmander occupy. <br>A place surrounded by the great midland ocean, where heavy rains fall, and beautiful sunsets exist.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/5f29f4c5b96fced96993030f349d2b52.poster.avif?t=1788973110\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/5f29f4c5b96fced96993030f349d2b52.webm?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/5f29f4c5b96fced96993030f349d2b52.mp4?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">In order to escape the island you'll need to gather a pack. A group of poppy friends to help you solve the puzzle of the island. They may ask for favors or just want to hang out. <br>Be careful though not to upset them, as the slightest bump can set a poppy off.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/4fc6316b62bcc38eb8c466edc2e6a74c.poster.avif?t=1788973110\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/4fc6316b62bcc38eb8c466edc2e6a74c.webm?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/4fc6316b62bcc38eb8c466edc2e6a74c.mp4?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">With a large enough pack you'll be able to perform feats of thermion magic. <br>A powerful tool in repelling enemies, or causing mayhem.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/c05bbad24c178196851c468047a41f14.poster.avif?t=1788973110\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/c05bbad24c178196851c468047a41f14.webm?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839240/extras/c05bbad24c178196851c468047a41f14.mp4?t=1788973110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The island is overseen by a powerful Aquance mage, a manipulator of water. <br>Holding the key to leaving the island, you'll need to become a true demon in order to defeat this mage.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hand drawn pixel-art and low-poly style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whimsical and interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Physics-driven gameplay mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cuteness overload.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A short, mysterious puzzle to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Original music full of mysterious ambiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Around 10-30 minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Red pandas! <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
